				<r3d:remarks>SAHMDA was one of the core partners of Inter-University Consortium for Political and Social Research (ICPSR)re3data100010255 . As of August 21, 2015 SAMHSA contracted with a different vendor to distribute NSDUH, DAWN, and other SAMHDA restricted-use data.  Questions about SAMHSA restricted-use data should be sent to samhda-support@samhsa.hhs.gov. ICPSR will continue to distribute public-use files created by the SAMHDA project. Users interested in substance abuse data are encouraged to search the ICPSR catalog and to visit the National Addiction &amp; HIV Data Archive Program.</r3d:remarks>
